sequenceDiagram
    participant Authority as Authority User
    participant Gate as eFTI Gate (eu-xx01)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GateFI as Remote Gate (eu-yy01)
    participant GateDE as Remote Gate (eu-yy02)

    Authority->>+Gate: GET /v1/identifiers/999ZZZ?registrationCountryCode=EE
    Note over Authority,Gate: Accept: text/event-stream<br/>X-Request-ID echoed.

    Gate->>Gate: Authenticate & authorize (resolve users row)

    Gate->>+DB: Local identifier search:<br/>resolve latest consignments rows matching vehicle_plate='999ZZZ',<br/>keep only those whose latest status = 'active'.
    DB-->>-Gate: 0 results

    Note over Gate: local=0 → broadcast<br/>to all online gates.

    Gate-->>Authority: HTTP 200 OK (text/event-stream)
    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"eu-xx01","responseTimeMs":3,"consignments":null}

    par Broadcast to all online gates
        Gate->>+GateFI: IdentifierQueryRequest (id="999ZZZ")
        Gate->>+GateDE: IdentifierQueryRequest (id="999ZZZ")
    end

    GateFI->>GateFI: Query local DB, 0 results
    GateFI-->>-Gate: IdentifierQueryResponse (0 consignments)
    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"eu-yy01","responseTimeMs":145}

    GateDE->>GateDE: Query local DB, 0 results
    GateDE-->>-Gate: IdentifierQueryResponse (0 consignments)
    Gate-->>Authority: event: gate\ndata: {"gateId":"eu-yy02","responseTimeMs":189}

    Note over Gate: All gates responded.<br/>0 total results.

    Gate-->>Authority: event: complete\ndata: {}
    Gate-->>-Authority: SSE stream closed

    Note over Authority: 0 consignments found.<br/>Identifier not registered<br/>in eFTI network.
